        <mxCell id="AAnmvTd6dEIthUsueiIe-26" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Georgia&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;On ImpossibleBench, Claude models did more than 79% of their cheating by editing the tests. Fence first, then run the gates.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1" parent="layer-labels" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fillColor=#F5F5F5;gradientColor=#D9D5CC;gradientDirection=south;strokeColor=#B1ACA2;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Georgia;fontSize=16;fontColor=#4D4D4D;sketch=1;sketchStyle=comic;jiggle=1;curveFitting=1;shadow=1;shadowOpacity=75;shadowOffsetX=6;shadowOffsetY=5;shadowBlur=4;">
